  "name": "luh-urban-gnss-campaings-from-2015-2017-in-hamburg-grob-flottbek-from-simultan-project",
  "notes": "This data set contains the raw data bundle of all gnss campaigns carried out in the years between autumn 2015 unti autumn 2017. Campaigns were measured semi annual and summarized in technical reports, which are elements of this data set.\r\nThe campaings are captured under urban conditions and contain a lot of cycle slips and multipath. \r\nThe aim of these gnss campaings have been the monitoring of surface displacements caused by subsidence processes.",
